LOVA M6 Day 2 -- body-scanning DeltaTrap (Q20)

==============================================================================
  Demo 1 -- canonical жд-trap shapes: old outer-op vs new body_offender
==============================================================================

  program                                      dev  offender                          correction
  ------------------------------------------  ----  --------------------------------  ----------
  (conserve 77 (violate 77))                    +1  violate @ path=() d=0                     -1
  (conserve 10 (merge 7 4))                     +1  merge @ path=() d=0                       -1
  (conserve 10 (merge (violate 3) 4))           -2  violate @ path=(0,) d=1                   +2
  (conserve 5 (violate (violate 2)))            -1  violate @ path=(0,) d=1                   +1
  (conserve 10 7)                               -3  lit @ path=() d=0                         +3

  Old signal in all five: offending_op == CONSERVE (the trap-raising
  frame -- uniform across every case, hence uninformative).
  New signal: specific sub-expression + correction value.

